{"content":"h06.\n\n**RPC handlers that transitively trigger an outbound HTTP call to a user‑configured URL** (all are Connect/gRPC methods on `v1.APIV1Service`, wired through `MemoService`):\n\n- `APIV1Service.CreateMemo` — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go:70` → `DispatchMemoCreatedWebhook` (`memo_service_webhooks.go:15`) → `dispatchMemoRelatedWebhook` (`memo_service_webhooks.go:48`)\n- `APIV1Service.UpdateMemo` — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go:401` → `dispatchMemoUpdatedSideEffects` (`memo_update_helpers.go:66`) → `DispatchMemoUpdatedWebhook` (`memo_service_webhooks.go:20`) → `dispatchMemoRelatedWebhook`\n- `APIV1Service.DeleteMemo` — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go:518` → `DispatchMemoDeletedWebhook` (`memo_service_webhooks.go:25`) → `dispatchMemoRelatedWebhook`\n- `APIV1Service.CreateMemoComment` — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service_comments.go:20` → `DispatchMemoCommentCreatedWebhook` (`memo_service_webhooks.go:29`), which loads the target's stored webhook `Url`/`SigningSecret` (`s.Store.GetUserWebhooks`) and calls `webhook.PostAsync`\n\nEach of these dispatch helpers builds a `webhook.WebhookRequestPayload{URL: hook.Url, ...}` from the user's stored webhook configuration (`store.WebhooksUserSetting_Webhook.Url`) and hands it to `webhook.PostAsync` (`internal/webhook/webhook.go:184`), which enqueues it on `asyncPostQueue`; four background goroutines started in `init()` (`internal/webhook/webhook.go:42-55`) drain that queue and call `Post`.\n\n**Convergence function — path:** `webhook.Post` — `internal/webhook/webhook.go:120` (issues the actual outbound request via `safeClient.Do(req)` at line 152, against `requestPayload.URL`, i.e. the user-configured webhook URL). All four handler paths above funnel through this single function before any byte leaves the process.","iteration":8,"turn":1,"type":"assistant"}
